% The British Nationality Act 1981, section 1(1), much simplified:
% the Prolog program of demo B (bna_s1.pl), in Logical English.
% Open it in the editor at https://le2.logicalcontracts.com with File > Open.
the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
*a person* acquires British citizenship on *a date*.
*a person* is born in *a place* on *a date*.
*a person* counts as a parent of *a person*.
*a person* is the mother of *a person*.
*a person* is the father of *a person*.
*a person* is married to *a person*.
*a person* is a British citizen on *a date*.
*a person* is settled in the UK on *a date*.

the knowledge base section_1_1 includes:

rule s1_1 with provenance the British Nationality Act 1981 at "section 1(1)":
a person acquires British citizenship on a date
if the person is born in the UK on the date
    and the date is after or equal to 1983-01-01
    and an other person counts as a parent of the person
    and the other person is a British citizen on the date
        or the other person is settled in the UK on the date.

rule s50_9_mother with provenance the British Nationality Act 1981 at "section 50(9)":
a person counts as a parent of an other person
if the person is the mother of the other person.

rule s50_9_father with provenance the British Nationality Act 1981 at "section 50(9), as passed in 1981":
a person counts as a parent of an other person
if the person is the father of the other person
    and a third person is the mother of the other person
    and the person is married to the third person.

rule s50_9A_father with provenance the British Nationality Act 1981 at "section 50(9A), in force from 1 July 2006":
a person counts as a parent of an other person
if the person is the father of the other person
    and the other person is born in a place on a date
    and the date is after or equal to 2006-07-01.

scenario john is:
    John is born in the UK on 2021-10-09.
    Alice is the mother of John.
    Alice is a British citizen on 2021-10-09.
    one expects answers ["John acquires British citizenship on 2021-10-09"].

scenario mary is:
    Mary is born in the UK on 2022-03-01.
    Beth is the mother of Mary.
    Harry is the father of Mary.
    Harry is settled in the UK on 2022-03-01.
    one expects answers ["Mary acquires British citizenship on 2022-03-01"].

scenario tom is:
    Tom is born in the UK on 2000-05-01.
    Carol is the mother of Tom.
    Harry is the father of Tom.
    Harry is settled in the UK on 2000-05-01.
    one expects answers [].

scenario tom_married is:
    Tom is born in the UK on 2000-05-01.
    Carol is the mother of Tom.
    Harry is the father of Tom.
    Harry is married to Carol.
    Harry is settled in the UK on 2000-05-01.
    one expects answers ["Tom acquires British citizenship on 2000-05-01"].

query one is:
    which person acquires British citizenship on which date.
